    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d798">

                <pb facs="0697" n="685" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg685"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.24/286: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Under Secretary of State</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Assistant
                        Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Acheson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-03-13">March 13, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Acheson</hi>: A copy of telegram 144, March 11,
                    4 p.m. from Ankara has been sent to you. I fully share Mr. Steinhardt’s views
                    and in accordance with the policy we have all agreed upon, prompt action should
                    now be taken to give some concrete evidence to the Turkish Government that we
                    are doing something for it.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
